    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fun little physics tower defense like game where creativity and embracing the chaos that ensues is key.</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/45848d82fcff65309e9b380a3e001aea.poster.avif?t=1704282128\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/45848d82fcff65309e9b380a3e001aea.webm?t=1704282128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/45848d82fcff65309e9b380a3e001aea.mp4?t=1704282128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Defend your king by equipping his castle with elaborate traps!<br>Play increasingly difficult levels where the king is in his castle and needs to be defended. <br>Be creative in placing and activating a wide variety of trap to prevent the invaders from reaching your king.<br>The war chest is limited though, and all invaders must be dead when the countdown hits zero. <br>What creative solutions will you come up with? Will you sacrifice the enormous statue of your king and make it fall on top of our<br>invaders? Maybe you'll risk summoning a lightning storm which is very effective, but can also potentialy kill the king?<br>Or, if you like a more &quot;hands on&quot; approach, there's always the possibility to fling boulders at the enemy yourself ofcourse. <br><strong>Experiment! Enjoy the chaos! Reign down everything you've got on your enemies!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/d7983865383e0662139a0623739bc1ee.poster.avif?t=1704282128\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/d7983865383e0662139a0623739bc1ee.webm?t=1704282128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/d7983865383e0662139a0623739bc1ee.mp4?t=1704282128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 Enemy Classes</h2>Fight different enemy types each with their unique strengths and weaknesses to specific traps. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/382b82a997fe676efc44c6012da1c46b.poster.avif?t=1704282128\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/382b82a997fe676efc44c6012da1c46b.webm?t=1704282128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/382b82a997fe676efc44c6012da1c46b.mp4?t=1704282128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 Unique Contraptions</h2>Complete levels and unlock a wide range of different contraptions. Floortraps, springboards, rolling boulders and more<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/4c6c7c292d98576b8d511295cd9f6a21.poster.avif?t=1704282128\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/4c6c7c292d98576b8d511295cd9f6a21.webm?t=1704282128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/4c6c7c292d98576b8d511295cd9f6a21.mp4?t=1704282128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >10 Challenging Levels</h2>Unlock new levels by completing others.<br>Play old levels again to earn some extra coin or to try new tactics with the contraptions you've unlocked.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1704282128\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1704282128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fun little physics tower defense like game where creativity and embracing the chaos that ensues is key.</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/45848d82fcff65309e9b380a3e001aea.poster.avif?t=1704282128\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/45848d82fcff65309e9b380a3e001aea.webm?t=1704282128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/45848d82fcff65309e9b380a3e001aea.mp4?t=1704282128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Defend your king by equipping his castle with elaborate traps!<br>Play increasingly difficult levels where the king is in his castle and needs to be defended. <br>Be creative in placing and activating a wide variety of trap to prevent the invaders from reaching your king.<br>The war chest is limited though, and all invaders must be dead when the countdown hits zero. <br>What creative solutions will you come up with? Will you sacrifice the enormous statue of your king and make it fall on top of our<br>invaders? Maybe you'll risk summoning a lightning storm which is very effective, but can also potentialy kill the king?<br>Or, if you like a more &quot;hands on&quot; approach, there's always the possibility to fling boulders at the enemy yourself ofcourse. <br><strong>Experiment! Enjoy the chaos! Reign down everything you've got on your enemies!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677850/extras/d7983865383e0662139a0623739bc1ee.poster.avif?t=1704282128\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass